// "LeavesBattlefield" = a permanent moves from the battlefield to ANY other
// zone ([CR#603.6c]: leaves-the-battlefield abilities trigger when a
// permanent moves from the battlefield to another zone; written as, but not
// limited to, "When [this object] leaves the battlefield, ..."). The
// destination is left unconstrained (`to` omitted) — `Dies`/`Destroyed`/
// `Sacrificed` narrow the same `ZoneChange` shape to the graveyard-specific
// view. See also [CR#603.10] (look-back-in-time triggers).
// Usage: LeavesBattlefield(what) — e.g. LeavesBattlefield(Type("Creature")),
// LeavesBattlefield(Ref(This)).
(
    name: "LeavesBattlefield",
    template: "${0} leaves the battlefield",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: ZoneChange(what: Param(0), from: Battlefield),
)
